      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EXAMINER (1) has mixed form recently, finishing seventh (23.02) in a Grade 5 at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Can make amends this time. BLACKPOOL VIPER (4) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing eighth (23.17) in a Grade 6 at this track. Can do much better this time. XENI BALE (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.80) at this track behind Our Benson in a Mix 5. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Expecting another good run. PAGE ONE NEWS (5) took charge early and was never headed last time out. Hard to beat.",
